From 4fa78868869afb429402eb8bf4a414ea9aa127b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:40:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] feat(2d): support 2D Contour on DXF sketches

Add layer/chain picking, per-chain side and direction overrides, ray picking,
open-chain safety checks, meshless verify/stock simulation, and UI/MCP
integration for 2D Contour on placed DXF sketch profiles.

Fixes #1864
